body.zh-TW:
想要讓程式碼版本庫的歷史紀錄保持純淨，現在可以在設定檔中加入 `"attribution": false` 來關閉所有 Commit 與 Pull Request 的工具署名。若是團隊多人共用設定檔，請務必保留完整的大括號物件格式，避免舊版 CLI 遇到未知格式時直接略過整份設定檔。⟦跟寄出公文時拿掉編輯軟體的浮水印一樣，讓產出的紀錄完全只保留你的工作成果。⟧

```json
{
  "attribution": false
}
```

body.en:
To keep code repository history clean, you can now add `"attribution": false` in settings to turn off all commit and pull request tool attribution. If multiple team members share a configuration file, keep the full curly-brace object format to prevent older CLI versions from skipping the entire settings file when encountering an unknown format. ⟦This works like removing a word processor's watermark when dispatching an official document, keeping the resulting records solely focused on your work.⟧

```json
{
  "attribution": false
}
```
